      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="rwanda.html">Rwanda</a> / Women-Only Rwanda Retreat</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Our sisterhood departure to Rwanda blends one of the world's most moving wildlife encounters with genuine rest — a morning with the mountain gorillas, then wellness, reflection and connection by the calm shores of Lake Kivu, in an intimate group of 8–12 women led by a female host.</p>
        <p>Vetted lodges, gentle pacing and time with the women's cooperatives we support. Come solo and leave with friends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive &amp; gather in Kigali</h3><p>Met at the airport and welcomed with a visit to the women-led Nyamirambo neighbourhood, then a welcome dinner with your host in the capital.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kigali boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To the Volcanoes</h3><p>Drive north through terraced hills to the foot of the Virungas. An afternoon of gentle yoga and a briefing for the trek to come.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking</h3><p>The morning you came for — into the forest with trackers ahead for a magical, regulated hour with a mountain gorilla family. The afternoon is yours to rest and reflect together.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Lake Kivu</h3><p>A scenic descent to the lake. Sunset yoga on the shore and a quiet first evening by the water.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Kivu wellness &amp; women's cooperative</h3><p>Morning yoga, a coffee-farm visit and time with a women's cooperative — weaving, stories and shared chai — then a free afternoon to swim, paddle or simply be.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Kigali &amp; farewell</h3><p>A final sunrise stretch by the lake, then a scenic drive back to Kigali for your onward flight — rested, restored and among new friends.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

