        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$7,800 per person sharing</strong>; single rooms available on request. International flights, visas and a second gorilla permit are extra. Rwanda's gorilla permit is premium-priced and limited — we book early. Set departures run in the drier months (June–September &amp; December–February); minimum age 15.</p>
